WEBVTT

01:40.539 --> 01:44.170
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.050 --> 01:47.190
[Episode 32]

01:48.280 --> 01:48.950
Your eyes

01:48.950 --> 01:50.310
are just temporary blind.

01:54.509 --> 01:56.310
When I was at Tianqu Peak,

01:56.710 --> 01:57.590
I could only see

01:59.509 --> 02:00.790
a small patch

02:01.200 --> 02:02.590
of the sky when I looked up.

02:04.000 --> 02:05.520
At that time, I thought

02:06.400 --> 02:07.590
that after I got out,

02:08.289 --> 02:10.199
I had to take a good look at the stars.

02:11.470 --> 02:12.360
I didn't expect

02:13.080 --> 02:14.470
that when I really got out,

02:15.750 --> 02:16.520
I didn't feel like

02:16.520 --> 02:18.120
stargazing anymore.

02:26.310 --> 02:27.150
Look over there.

02:27.870 --> 02:29.000
It's the Maiden constellation.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.120
It's shaped like a basket

02:31.810 --> 02:32.940
and looks like the character "woman."

02:34.760 --> 02:35.720
And there.

02:36.120 --> 02:37.630
Those five are the Lizhu constellation.

02:38.240 --> 02:39.240
Its appearance

02:39.800 --> 02:41.400
is like a backward bowl.

02:40.760 --> 02:42.040
♫Listening♫

02:42.070 --> 02:45.329
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

02:45.350 --> 02:48.320
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

02:49.120 --> 02:50.480
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

02:50.500 --> 02:52.470
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

02:52.660 --> 02:57.130
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

02:57.850 --> 02:59.010
♫Tonight♫

02:59.180 --> 03:03.030
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

03:03.060 --> 03:05.910
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

03:06.300 --> 03:07.930
♫I only wish♫

03:07.960 --> 03:09.790
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

03:10.190 --> 03:14.360
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

03:14.980 --> 03:15.950
♫The wind blows♫

03:15.970 --> 03:17.370
♫It stirs the scenery♫

03:17.579 --> 03:19.120
♫It awakens our heart♫

03:19.140 --> 03:22.790
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

03:23.410 --> 03:24.660
♫The closer we get♫

03:24.000 --> 03:25.280
I wish time

03:24.680 --> 03:26.290
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

03:26.310 --> 03:27.680
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

03:26.520 --> 03:27.840
can stop at this moment.

03:27.700 --> 03:32.020
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

03:32.180 --> 03:33.150
♫The wind blows♫

03:33.170 --> 03:34.570
♫It stirs the scenery♫

03:34.780 --> 03:36.320
♫It awakens our heart♫

03:36.350 --> 03:39.990
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

03:40.620 --> 03:41.860
♫The closer we get♫

03:41.890 --> 03:43.490
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

03:43.510 --> 03:44.880
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

03:44.910 --> 03:49.230
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

03:49.360 --> 03:50.360
♫The wind blows♫

03:50.380 --> 03:52.140
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

03:52.190 --> 03:53.840
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

03:53.860 --> 03:58.040
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

03:58.060 --> 03:59.290
♫The wind blows♫

03:59.320 --> 04:00.910
♫It reddens my eyes♫

04:00.940 --> 04:02.940
♫It warms the promise we made♫

04:03.050 --> 04:06.570
♫In the wind, we gently♫

04:06.600 --> 04:09.280
♫Drift into a better place♫

04:15.630 --> 04:16.750
There's a shabby temple ahead.

04:16.800 --> 04:17.630
We can rest there.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.190
You're tired?

04:20.180 --> 04:21.980
Zhi Dai, are you tired?

04:25.240 --> 04:27.190
Even if you're not, the horse is.

04:27.830 --> 04:28.870
I know you are anxious.

04:29.120 --> 04:30.120
I am too.

04:30.270 --> 04:31.310
Please listen advice occasionally,

04:31.310 --> 04:32.360
Young Master Tanghua.

04:32.500 --> 04:34.530
How can we search when we're all tired?

04:35.800 --> 04:36.600
Let's go.

05:05.300 --> 05:06.690
Embroidery God Temple?

05:18.240 --> 05:19.040
What's wrong?

05:20.630 --> 05:21.430
Nothing.

05:25.120 --> 05:25.920
It's safe here.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.430
I'll find some hay to feed the horses.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.170
Zhi Dai.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.870
You look a little dazed.

05:36.960 --> 05:37.890
Are you tired?

05:39.520 --> 05:40.310
A bit.

05:41.240 --> 05:42.040
It's my fault.

05:42.360 --> 05:43.630
I was busy searching

05:44.080 --> 05:45.230
and forgot your cultivation.

05:45.740 --> 05:47.060
It's time to rest.

05:51.680 --> 05:52.320
Here.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.540
Good. This mat can be used.

06:09.190 --> 06:10.360
Although it's a bit shabby,

06:10.430 --> 06:11.630
it's better than nothing.

06:12.950 --> 06:13.750
Zhi Dai,

06:14.340 --> 06:15.420
take a rest.

06:15.510 --> 06:16.720
I’ll go hunt some wild game.

06:16.950 --> 06:18.160
I’ll tell Qian Lin

06:18.160 --> 06:19.430
not to disturb you.

06:19.510 --> 06:20.750
Have a good rest.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.070
Okay.

06:29.300 --> 06:30.370
It's been years.

06:33.550 --> 06:35.920
How does it feel to be young?

06:38.990 --> 06:40.480
Goddess of Embroidery.

06:41.680 --> 06:43.920
You still remember me? Not bad.

06:48.870 --> 06:50.310
You've helped me a lot.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.159
All these years,

06:52.430 --> 06:54.750
I've prayed and worshipped you.

06:54.930 --> 06:56.720
I never dared to forget, even for one day.

06:57.280 --> 06:58.250
That's good.

06:59.050 --> 07:00.440
Do you remember

07:00.950 --> 07:01.800
what I told you

07:01.800 --> 07:03.240
when you begged me

07:03.800 --> 07:05.190
to give you youth?

07:06.270 --> 07:07.070
I told you,

07:07.510 --> 07:08.630
"A god won't bestow blessings

07:08.630 --> 07:10.040
upon a useless person.

07:10.380 --> 07:11.820
Instead of kneeling down to me,

07:12.360 --> 07:14.070
why don't you make a deal with me?"

07:15.160 --> 07:15.950
Now,

07:16.430 --> 07:17.430
it's time for you

07:17.430 --> 07:19.000
to complete the deal.

08:13.350 --> 08:14.350
You can see now?

08:17.680 --> 08:18.740
You can see now?

08:18.820 --> 08:19.680
You can see now,

08:19.680 --> 08:20.560
right, Yuanzhong?

08:23.930 --> 08:25.410
Maybe I've recovered.

08:26.640 --> 08:27.600
Great.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.510
Can you leave now?

08:29.530 --> 08:30.780
I'll pack your luggage.

08:32.059 --> 08:33.740
Do you really want us to leave?

08:34.720 --> 08:35.789
No.

08:35.960 --> 08:37.799
Didn't you say that you only came

08:37.960 --> 08:39.120
to recuperate

08:39.120 --> 08:41.440
and will leave after he's recovered?

08:41.909 --> 08:43.840
Yuanzhong not only has an eye injury,

08:43.840 --> 08:44.910
but also a knife injury.

08:44.910 --> 08:46.150
He's still injured.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.150
A knife injury?

08:50.600 --> 08:51.960
You got quite a lot of injuries.

08:54.600 --> 08:55.390
Yes.

08:55.790 --> 08:57.270
So, we might need to

08:57.270 --> 08:58.840
trouble you for a while longer.

09:02.440 --> 09:03.240
Fine.

09:03.260 --> 09:05.020
I'm not an unreasonable person.

09:05.410 --> 09:06.890
You're injured.

09:07.090 --> 09:08.330
Take a good rest.

09:23.720 --> 09:24.720
Yuanzhong's injury

09:24.870 --> 09:25.840
needs some more time

09:25.840 --> 09:26.960
to recover.

09:27.320 --> 09:28.870
Now that the celestial ladder has been destroyed,

09:29.270 --> 09:30.510
and the Ascension Platform was sealed,

09:30.910 --> 09:32.600
the only passage between the human and deity realms

09:32.670 --> 09:34.200
is the Sea of Flux.

09:34.750 --> 09:36.150
That's a place beyond the boundaries.

09:36.580 --> 09:37.660
It's extremely dangerous.

09:38.630 --> 09:40.350
Now that I've lost my divine bone,

09:40.870 --> 09:42.000
it's even harder.

09:42.710 --> 09:44.400
I need a perfect plan.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.320
Spatial Spell!

10:11.360 --> 10:12.150
Juanjuan?

10:15.440 --> 10:16.230
Juanjuan.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.320
There's no one in the room.

10:20.640 --> 10:21.610
No one?

10:23.510 --> 10:25.120
What a pity.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.910
I made a table of delicious dishes,

10:26.910 --> 10:28.080
but there's no one to eat it.

10:28.810 --> 10:29.930
What delicious dishes?

10:30.390 --> 10:31.270
Let me see.

10:32.110 --> 10:33.440
Wasn't there no one here?

10:33.960 --> 10:35.290
Now there is one,

10:35.720 --> 10:36.670
okay?

10:42.390 --> 10:43.390
It's so delicious.

10:43.390 --> 10:44.080
How can you

10:44.080 --> 10:45.240
cook so well?

10:45.790 --> 10:46.630
Eat slowly.

10:46.760 --> 10:47.880
Have some water.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.410
A little.

10:57.020 --> 10:58.340
Your craftsmanship is so good.

10:58.480 --> 10:59.480
I didn't expect you

10:59.480 --> 11:00.360
to be so good at cooking too.

11:00.630 --> 11:01.510
I thought

11:01.510 --> 11:02.720
your cooking skills

11:02.720 --> 11:03.890
are similar to mine.

11:04.960 --> 11:06.550
I used to be at your level,

11:06.790 --> 11:07.600
but

11:07.790 --> 11:08.600
to become

11:08.600 --> 11:09.750
Yuanzhong's handmaiden,

11:09.870 --> 11:11.480
I trained hard for a long time.

11:13.360 --> 11:14.910
I really don't understand

11:15.000 --> 11:16.840
what you see in Yuanzhong.

11:19.840 --> 11:21.150
I cook so well.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.670
Do you want to learn from me?

11:23.030 --> 11:24.510
Otherwise, when I leave,

11:24.510 --> 11:25.240
you won't be able to

11:25.240 --> 11:26.480
have so much delicious food.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.270
But cooking is too troublesome.

11:30.910 --> 11:32.360
It's not difficult at all.

11:33.030 --> 11:33.790
You

11:33.790 --> 11:35.390
cook to please Yuanzhong.

11:35.390 --> 11:36.960
I don't have anyone to please.

11:38.080 --> 11:40.120
What about pleasing yourself?

11:43.010 --> 11:44.640
Forget it. I'll just be lazy.

11:49.320 --> 11:50.120
Then,

11:51.030 --> 11:52.790
do you want to learn craftsmanship from me?

11:53.290 --> 11:54.530
I'm not bragging,

11:54.790 --> 11:56.910
but my craftsmanship is the best in the three realms.

11:56.930 --> 11:57.960
The best in the world.

11:58.200 --> 11:59.200
Many people want me

11:59.200 --> 12:00.320
to be their teacher.

12:00.550 --> 12:01.360
But

12:01.670 --> 12:03.360
I think you're very smart.

12:03.430 --> 12:05.120
Why don't I take you as my disciple?

12:05.170 --> 12:06.600
How about I teach you

12:06.630 --> 12:08.230
all my amazing skills?

12:09.440 --> 12:12.320
Do you need my help?

12:15.600 --> 12:16.810
Just say it.

12:16.970 --> 12:17.970
What is it?

12:18.800 --> 12:20.890
Then I'll get straight to the point.

12:21.960 --> 12:22.790
Go ahead.

12:24.630 --> 12:25.910
Your Barrier Spell

12:26.030 --> 12:27.790
is magic created with the rules

12:27.790 --> 12:29.080
of heaven and earth.

12:30.030 --> 12:31.840
So you came for this?

12:32.840 --> 12:33.630
Yes.

12:33.630 --> 12:34.650
Are you interested?

12:34.670 --> 12:35.360
Yes.

12:36.390 --> 12:37.600
Actually, I've learned

12:37.600 --> 12:38.870
some spatial rules.

12:38.870 --> 12:40.200
And through craftsmanship,

12:40.200 --> 12:40.720
I've also grasped

12:40.720 --> 12:42.390
how to change the size of space.

12:42.920 --> 12:44.040
But now,

12:44.760 --> 12:46.190
I need to go somewhere.

12:46.630 --> 12:48.790
The environment there is extremely dangerous.

12:49.150 --> 12:51.080
If I only have my knowledge of space,

12:51.240 --> 12:52.670
I'm afraid it's not enough to pass.

12:52.910 --> 12:53.630
So I want to learn

12:53.630 --> 12:54.910
your Barrier Spell

12:55.030 --> 12:56.000
to divide space

12:56.000 --> 12:57.720
and reject external objects.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.590
I see.

13:00.080 --> 13:02.030
But it's complicated.

13:07.070 --> 13:09.120
Actually, the Barrier Spell,

13:09.200 --> 13:10.000
put bluntly,

13:10.000 --> 13:11.750
is just the method of space separation.

13:12.460 --> 13:14.180
Everything is intertwined.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.200
Even the laws of heaven and earth

13:16.200 --> 13:17.270
are intertwined.

13:17.960 --> 13:19.200
In fact, everywhere visible

13:19.200 --> 13:20.240
to the naked eye

13:20.510 --> 13:22.150
has undetectable spatial cracks

13:22.150 --> 13:24.320
everywhere and at all times.

13:25.960 --> 13:27.030
Is that so?

13:28.000 --> 13:29.910
I think even

13:29.910 --> 13:31.720
the dangerous place you mentioned

13:31.720 --> 13:32.600
is the same.

13:38.790 --> 13:39.670
Again.

13:39.670 --> 13:40.870
It's almost done.

13:42.080 --> 13:44.080
Don't mind it. Try again. Hurry.

13:44.600 --> 13:45.390
Okay.

13:56.080 --> 13:56.870
It's done!

13:57.190 --> 13:58.740
Ji Tanyin, you did it!

13:59.360 --> 14:00.480
How did you do it?

14:00.480 --> 14:01.200
Try again.

14:01.200 --> 14:02.200
Let me see.

14:02.200 --> 14:02.910
Sure.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.270
Awesome!

14:14.270 --> 14:15.600
You're amazing!

14:16.150 --> 14:16.910
Do you know

14:16.910 --> 14:18.360
how long I practiced this?

14:18.840 --> 14:19.870
I can't believe you

14:19.870 --> 14:20.870
learned it immediately.

14:21.180 --> 14:22.150
It's nothing.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.360
No.

14:23.510 --> 14:24.600
I just told you

14:24.600 --> 14:25.720
my own understanding.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.440
You learned so much

14:27.480 --> 14:28.750
on your own.

14:28.870 --> 14:30.240
I don't even know this.

14:30.510 --> 14:31.550
You're…

14:32.010 --> 14:33.140
You're just...

14:40.080 --> 14:40.870
What's wrong?

14:40.950 --> 14:41.790
The moon!

14:43.510 --> 14:45.030
It's midnight.

14:45.840 --> 14:46.750
What's wrong with the moon?

14:46.750 --> 14:48.600
What's wrong? This is a huge problem!

14:48.600 --> 14:49.320
I usually sleep

14:49.320 --> 14:50.910
before midnight.

14:50.910 --> 14:52.910
I've kept this habit for 10 years.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.320
No, no.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.630
I have to go to bed now.

14:56.750 --> 14:57.550
Ji Tanyin,

14:57.870 --> 14:58.600
goodbye.

14:58.600 --> 14:59.840
Let's practice tomorrow.

14:59.950 --> 15:00.760
Bye.

16:47.950 --> 16:48.820
Time to go.

17:10.510 --> 17:11.480
Still reading?

17:12.140 --> 17:13.410
Eat something first.

17:13.520 --> 17:14.569
I just made it.

17:14.599 --> 17:15.440
Eat it while it's hot.

17:16.160 --> 17:16.960
Okay.

17:20.069 --> 17:21.390
The weather is nice today.

17:21.510 --> 17:22.550
After dinner,

17:22.550 --> 17:23.720
come take a walk.

17:23.720 --> 17:25.000
It'll help you recover.

17:26.540 --> 17:28.390
I picked it this morning.

17:28.410 --> 17:30.130
It's fresh. Try it.

17:53.510 --> 17:55.000
I think you should be

17:56.110 --> 17:57.790
mostly recovered.

18:13.720 --> 18:15.440
If you're almost recovered,

18:16.400 --> 18:17.270
I plan on…

18:19.360 --> 18:21.160
I plan on leaving.

18:27.790 --> 18:28.680
How do you feel?

18:54.440 --> 18:55.720
How did this happen?

18:56.590 --> 18:58.200
Why is it getting worse?

18:58.600 --> 18:59.400
Yes.

18:59.600 --> 19:01.270
How long has it been?

19:01.300 --> 19:02.740
It shouldn't be bleeding anymore.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.480
Yuanzhong.

19:03.480 --> 19:04.510
Did you move around again

19:04.510 --> 19:05.590
and hurt your injury?

19:06.110 --> 19:07.030
Why are you glaring at me?

19:07.390 --> 19:08.980
I'm just caring for you.

19:09.790 --> 19:11.830
Yuanzhong was hurt by the God-Slaying Dagger.

19:12.260 --> 19:13.740
I had experienced this

19:13.760 --> 19:15.170
when in the Demon Warriors’ hands.

19:15.540 --> 19:16.910
I could feel an extremely strong

19:16.930 --> 19:18.450
malicious aura on the blade.

19:19.280 --> 19:20.120
Malicious aura?

19:21.350 --> 19:22.510
Ordinary weapons

19:22.810 --> 19:24.370
won't hurt Yuanzhong.

19:27.680 --> 19:28.720
Thank you.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.510
My injuries

19:30.960 --> 19:32.200
hinder you.

19:32.920 --> 19:33.720
I'm sorry.

19:34.270 --> 19:35.640
Don't say sorry.

19:37.160 --> 19:38.480
I should stay with you.

19:41.740 --> 19:42.630
By the way,

19:43.200 --> 19:44.250
where are you going?

19:45.110 --> 19:45.920
How about

19:46.300 --> 19:47.780
I go with you

19:48.200 --> 19:49.720
after I'm better?

19:53.110 --> 19:54.960
You should recuperate first.

19:55.750 --> 19:57.350
No, I have a question.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.160
Why

19:58.160 --> 19:59.680
don't we get rid of the malicious aura

19:59.680 --> 20:00.790
before healing the injury?

20:02.000 --> 20:02.680
Do you have

20:02.680 --> 20:04.110
medicine to remove the malicious aura?

20:04.480 --> 20:05.480
Of course.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.830
The War Demons' techniques

20:06.830 --> 20:07.920
carry malice.

20:07.920 --> 20:08.960
I hid a lot of

20:08.960 --> 20:09.550
malice-removing medicine

20:09.550 --> 20:10.920
before coming to live in seclusion.

20:18.840 --> 20:20.680
This is the Vermillion Fruit.

20:20.820 --> 20:22.730
It grows in the extremely hot region in the south

20:22.920 --> 20:24.350
and feeds on the power of geothermal fire.

20:24.470 --> 20:27.470
It is the natural enemy of malicious aura.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.880
Can I eat this directly?

20:31.370 --> 20:32.170
No.

20:32.240 --> 20:33.510
You need to peel it

20:33.510 --> 20:34.880
and separate the skin from the flesh.

20:34.880 --> 20:35.880
Then boil it in water

20:35.880 --> 20:37.240
for four hours

20:37.240 --> 20:38.830
and smoke it.

20:38.860 --> 20:41.100
After it dries, grind it into powder and mix with water.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.160
Finally, you can consume it.

20:44.340 --> 20:45.140
By the way,

20:45.670 --> 20:47.560
everyone in the Youhu Clan

20:47.680 --> 20:49.440
knows this method of countering malicious aura.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.720
Didn't Yuanzhong tell you?

20:51.640 --> 20:52.750
He probably forgot.

20:56.980 --> 20:58.540
I think the water is boiling.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.440
Should we

21:00.440 --> 21:01.920
peel it first?

21:02.510 --> 21:03.310
Yes.

21:03.740 --> 21:05.550
After peeling, steaming, drying,

21:05.650 --> 21:06.650
we'll grind it.

21:08.030 --> 21:09.070
Then did we

21:09.350 --> 21:10.030
boil the water

21:10.030 --> 21:11.270
too soon?

21:12.640 --> 21:13.480
It's okay.

21:13.500 --> 21:15.390
It's warmer here if we boil the water.

21:20.550 --> 21:21.350
Well,

21:21.490 --> 21:23.100
let me peel it with you.

21:23.130 --> 21:23.850
Sure.

21:25.640 --> 21:27.200
I can't even choose the right time

21:27.200 --> 21:28.350
to boil water.

21:28.830 --> 21:30.070
Am I stupid?

21:30.310 --> 21:31.270
No.

21:31.720 --> 21:32.590
Everyone has things

21:32.590 --> 21:33.920
we are not good at.

21:35.160 --> 21:36.350
But I think

21:36.370 --> 21:37.270
there's nothing

21:37.270 --> 21:38.550
I'm good at,

21:38.830 --> 21:39.750
Look.

21:39.960 --> 21:41.680
Isn't creating medicine

21:41.680 --> 21:42.920
something you are good at?

21:42.960 --> 21:44.890
But I read it from books.

21:45.790 --> 21:46.720
It's good

21:46.720 --> 21:48.270
to like reading.

21:48.480 --> 21:50.030
When I went to your room last time,

21:50.200 --> 21:50.960
I saw you had

21:50.960 --> 21:52.350
many good books.

21:56.200 --> 21:58.000
Yuanzhong likes reading too.

21:59.260 --> 22:00.830
When I was in the Liujiao Palace,

22:02.680 --> 22:04.680
he always had a book in his hand.

22:05.860 --> 22:06.940
Even now,

22:07.640 --> 22:08.790
he can read

22:09.730 --> 22:12.140
for a long time once he starts.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.030
No matter what happens,

22:15.160 --> 22:16.400
as long as there's a book,

22:17.130 --> 22:18.890
he seems to be able to settle down.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.640
I think

22:21.670 --> 22:23.160
there are two kinds of people in this world.

22:23.320 --> 22:24.160
One is

22:24.240 --> 22:25.920
the type who likes to read quietly.

22:25.920 --> 22:26.590
The other type

22:26.590 --> 22:28.200
likes running around.

22:29.110 --> 22:30.270
These aren't the only two types.

22:31.710 --> 22:32.510
What about you?

22:32.880 --> 22:33.920
Which type are you?

22:35.750 --> 22:37.550
I used to like reading.

22:39.030 --> 22:40.000
But later,

22:42.110 --> 22:43.110
somehow,

22:43.350 --> 22:44.480
I kept running around.

22:45.310 --> 22:46.110
Maybe

22:46.190 --> 22:47.920
I fell in love with running around.

22:49.490 --> 22:52.340
You're going to run around again,

22:53.000 --> 22:53.810
right?

22:56.790 --> 22:57.590
I won't run around.

22:58.450 --> 22:59.170
I'm leaving.

23:02.590 --> 23:03.640
I have my own matter

23:03.640 --> 23:04.550
to handle.

23:04.940 --> 23:05.940
If you leave,

23:06.470 --> 23:08.160
Yuanzhong will be very sad.

23:11.350 --> 23:12.550
I'll be back.

23:15.590 --> 23:16.640
They all say so.

23:17.400 --> 23:18.750
When people leave,

23:19.030 --> 23:19.960
they always say

23:20.040 --> 23:21.570
they'll come back.

23:21.960 --> 23:22.920
But after they leave,

23:23.680 --> 23:25.110
they never come back.

23:25.790 --> 23:26.960
Some goodbyes

23:27.230 --> 23:28.750
eventually turn permanent.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.720
When the Youhu Clan and War Demons

23:36.720 --> 23:37.790
were at war,

23:38.680 --> 23:40.110
my family and friends

23:40.130 --> 23:41.370
were all like this.

23:41.720 --> 23:43.270
They never came back.

23:44.360 --> 23:45.880
My family and friends

23:46.340 --> 23:48.010
were Yuanzhong's family and friends.

23:50.070 --> 23:50.830
What kind of person

23:50.830 --> 23:52.240
was Yuanzhong?

23:55.960 --> 23:56.750
Him?

23:56.830 --> 23:58.250
When he was little,

23:58.270 --> 23:59.590
he was very annoying.

24:00.270 --> 24:01.270
So naughty

24:01.270 --> 24:02.240
and mischievous.

24:02.310 --> 24:03.640
He liked to prank people too.

24:03.830 --> 24:05.310
He was the biggest troublemaker

24:05.350 --> 24:07.270
in the whole mountain.

24:07.750 --> 24:08.720
So noisy!

24:08.720 --> 24:09.680
But then,

24:09.790 --> 24:11.440
he got the Divine Left Hand,

24:11.720 --> 24:12.530
so…

24:14.240 --> 24:15.070
So what?

24:15.510 --> 24:16.510
He became

24:16.510 --> 24:18.030
even more annoying.

24:18.330 --> 24:19.570
He was arrogant.

24:19.720 --> 24:21.510
He thought he was great.

24:23.310 --> 24:24.310
And after that,

24:25.440 --> 24:26.920
he was sealed

24:27.500 --> 24:28.830
and he changed completely.

24:30.200 --> 24:31.000
Changed?

24:32.090 --> 24:33.900
He became like a mannequin.

24:36.200 --> 24:37.790
Did you see him later?

24:38.270 --> 24:39.070
He said

24:39.480 --> 24:40.590
you left after the two clans

24:40.590 --> 24:41.510
declared war.

24:42.520 --> 24:43.480
Actually,

24:43.630 --> 24:45.350
I went back once.

24:45.750 --> 24:46.550
But

24:46.640 --> 24:48.400
I thought everyone had changed.

24:48.400 --> 24:49.920
They'd become strangers,

24:50.000 --> 24:51.650
so I left again.

24:51.920 --> 24:52.720
But

24:53.160 --> 24:54.270
this time,

24:54.440 --> 24:55.790
I see you two together

24:55.980 --> 24:58.590
and I think he's changed again.

24:59.030 --> 25:01.270
He seems to have turned back

25:01.510 --> 25:02.480
into the

25:02.680 --> 25:04.070
annoying person.

25:04.510 --> 25:05.680
But no matter what,

25:05.750 --> 25:07.480
it's much better than that mannequin.

25:08.230 --> 25:09.030
So,

25:09.310 --> 25:10.200
don't let him

25:10.200 --> 25:11.590
turn back into that mannequin again,

25:11.820 --> 25:12.620
okay?

25:43.380 --> 25:44.490
Have some medicine.

25:55.110 --> 25:56.510
I'm leaving for a while.

26:06.000 --> 26:06.880
I wanted to wait

26:06.880 --> 26:08.200
until you recovered,

26:08.750 --> 26:10.400
but it's been delayed too long.

26:11.000 --> 26:12.000
There's no time.

26:13.160 --> 26:14.470
Everything is fine here.

26:15.030 --> 26:15.920
It's safe.

26:16.590 --> 26:17.300
You can stay here

26:17.320 --> 26:18.560
to recuperate in peace.

26:19.270 --> 26:20.350
Juanjuan will also...

26:20.350 --> 26:21.350
Where are you going?

26:32.720 --> 26:33.720
I'm going home.

26:39.680 --> 26:41.270
Something happened at home.

26:43.070 --> 26:44.200
But it's fine.

26:45.160 --> 26:46.200
Fortunately, some respected elders

26:46.200 --> 26:47.790
of the clan are there.

26:48.240 --> 26:49.200
With them there,

26:49.480 --> 26:50.650
they will be fine.

26:51.350 --> 26:52.720
As long as they think of

26:53.350 --> 26:54.400
a solution,

26:54.920 --> 26:56.350
it will be solved.

26:57.200 --> 26:58.830
You need to wait for me.

27:00.670 --> 27:02.160
Can't you be like before?

27:03.160 --> 27:03.960
What?

27:07.160 --> 27:08.510
Just like before

27:09.240 --> 27:10.480
when you pretended to die,

27:11.030 --> 27:12.030
without moving or speaking,

27:12.400 --> 27:13.480
without a breath or pulse,

27:13.720 --> 27:14.880
without consciousness,

27:15.510 --> 27:17.350
and wake up after a while.

27:18.630 --> 27:19.830
Can't you do that?

27:28.880 --> 27:30.270
You promised me

27:31.680 --> 27:32.930
you'll always be with me.

27:34.350 --> 27:35.400
Does it still count?

27:36.510 --> 27:37.510
Of course.

27:37.590 --> 27:38.720
Then why are you leaving?

27:39.030 --> 27:40.790
I'm just leaving for a while.

27:40.790 --> 27:42.110
How long is "a while"?

27:42.480 --> 27:43.400
Where are you going?

27:43.530 --> 27:44.480
Where is your home?

27:44.680 --> 27:46.160
Did something happen to you?

27:46.640 --> 27:47.440
If you don't come back,

27:47.440 --> 27:48.720
where can I find you?

27:49.070 --> 27:50.240
If you are in danger,

27:50.240 --> 27:51.350
how can I help you?

27:52.240 --> 27:53.160
How long

27:53.840 --> 27:54.800
must I wait for?

27:55.720 --> 27:57.440
How long before you're back?

28:05.920 --> 28:06.840
You want me to wait,

28:07.920 --> 28:08.590
but do you know

28:08.590 --> 28:09.510
how it feels

28:09.530 --> 28:10.700
to wait for someone?

28:09.920 --> 28:12.690
♫Going through thousands of years♫

28:10.880 --> 28:11.920
Didn't you promise me

28:11.920 --> 28:13.190
to be with me forever?

28:13.260 --> 28:16.450
♫In exchange for a dreamlike love♫

28:13.310 --> 28:14.480
To grow old with me,

28:15.000 --> 28:16.110
until my hair grays,

28:16.200 --> 28:17.310
my teeth fall out,

28:17.350 --> 28:19.030
and I'm surrounded by descendants,

28:17.600 --> 28:20.270
♫If the wind is all yours♫

28:19.030 --> 28:20.920
living a peaceful and stable life?

28:20.690 --> 28:24.700
♫No bitterness in your expression♫

28:23.920 --> 28:24.720
What?

28:25.220 --> 28:28.200
♫Everyone comes without a match♫

28:26.230 --> 28:27.750
Are you going back on your word?

28:28.400 --> 28:29.190
No.

28:28.450 --> 28:33.020
♫Why are they willing to be gentle?♫

28:29.370 --> 28:30.810
Then don't go anywhere.

28:31.740 --> 28:33.150
Stay here with me.

28:33.190 --> 28:36.250
♫The moment your image appeared in my eyes♫

28:36.870 --> 28:40.000
♫The answer appeared♫

28:40.860 --> 28:44.250
♫But time♫

28:41.110 --> 28:41.910
I can't.

28:43.840 --> 28:44.640
You can't?

28:44.670 --> 28:48.090
♫Always hides the waves and smoke♫

28:48.590 --> 28:52.470
♫Under the clouds, the good days♫

28:49.680 --> 28:50.720
Why not?

28:51.920 --> 28:53.310
Why can't you?

28:52.820 --> 28:56.470
♫Come and go in a flash♫

28:58.330 --> 29:01.970
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

29:02.300 --> 29:05.750
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

29:06.160 --> 29:10.040
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

29:10.230 --> 29:13.540
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

29:14.050 --> 29:17.290
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

29:18.000 --> 29:21.620
♫When I can only look back at you♫

29:22.040 --> 29:25.850
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

29:25.870 --> 29:30.580
♫I'll go no matter what♫

29:31.890 --> 29:35.120
♫Like the wind and moon, I'm filled with love♫

29:35.200 --> 29:36.110
Let's get married.

29:35.930 --> 29:39.210
♫But it makes people go to the end of the world♫

29:39.680 --> 29:40.960
Marry me.

29:39.710 --> 29:43.840
♫Willingly going through dawn and dusk♫

29:42.350 --> 29:44.510
Pray in front of the gods

29:43.860 --> 29:47.090
♫To embrace you and listen to the rain♫

29:45.030 --> 29:45.830
and say you're willing.

29:45.830 --> 29:47.550
to be my wife.

29:47.580 --> 29:51.340
♫Only then can I know what is memorable♫

29:49.410 --> 29:50.210
Then...

29:51.360 --> 29:55.030
♫When I can only look back at you♫

29:52.830 --> 29:54.070
I'll let you go.

29:55.490 --> 29:59.170
♫If there's still a way to continue♫

29:59.190 --> 30:03.740
♫I'll go no matter what♫

30:05.160 --> 30:10.480
♫I'll go no matter what♫

30:20.920 --> 30:21.720
What should we do now?

30:21.960 --> 30:23.110
Travel by water or land?

30:24.960 --> 30:26.090
We'll know after asking.

30:39.420 --> 30:41.700
Even though a tortoise lives long, its time still runs out.

30:42.200 --> 30:43.960
It's the same with the enchantment technique.

30:44.640 --> 30:46.110
It's almost time.

30:46.200 --> 30:47.410
You're getting old again.

30:47.670 --> 30:48.670
Aren't you afraid?

30:49.270 --> 30:50.070
Besides,

30:50.310 --> 30:51.790
even if you don't think for yourself,

30:52.000 --> 30:53.550
you should think for your people.

30:54.240 --> 30:55.880
You're now the City Lord of Yandu City.

30:56.270 --> 30:57.070
You don't want them

30:57.070 --> 30:58.400
to be punished

30:58.420 --> 30:59.980
because you deceived the gods, right?

31:00.660 --> 31:01.660
City Lord Dai,

31:02.100 --> 31:03.780
a wise person submits to fate.

31:04.420 --> 31:06.310
Do what I told you.

31:07.240 --> 31:08.030
Zhi Dai.

31:08.590 --> 31:09.400
What's wrong?

31:09.790 --> 31:10.590
Nothing.

31:12.240 --> 31:13.030
A man

31:13.480 --> 31:14.440
about this tall.

31:14.920 --> 31:16.310
The woman is very thin.

31:18.160 --> 31:19.270
A man and a woman.

31:20.200 --> 31:21.200
Let me guess.

31:21.510 --> 31:23.160
Were they driving a carriage?

31:24.110 --> 31:25.550
Such clear description.

31:25.880 --> 31:27.400
Have you seen the people we're looking for?

31:28.160 --> 31:29.240
You think too much.

31:29.750 --> 31:30.550
Haven't seen them.

31:31.000 --> 31:31.960
No?

31:32.270 --> 31:33.830
Then why do you know it so well?

31:33.990 --> 31:35.560
How can I not know?

31:35.640 --> 31:36.750
Are you kids

31:36.750 --> 31:38.480
going to kill the demons too?

31:40.570 --> 31:41.680
How do you know

31:42.270 --> 31:44.920
we're going to kill demons?

31:45.000 --> 31:47.410
You look smart.

31:47.510 --> 31:49.350
Why do you always ask silly questions?

31:49.790 --> 31:50.680
If you were me

31:50.830 --> 31:52.940
and a dozen of people asked you every day,

31:53.160 --> 31:54.750
you'd know everything too.

31:55.510 --> 31:56.800
You people

31:56.830 --> 31:58.830
just won't live a peaceful life.

31:59.200 --> 32:00.160
If you have time,

32:00.200 --> 32:01.590
why can't you spend it

32:01.590 --> 32:02.880
doing something useful?

32:03.350 --> 32:04.720
Today, you slaughter demons.

32:04.830 --> 32:06.070
Tomorrow, you kill gods.

32:06.270 --> 32:07.240
Do you know that civilians

32:07.240 --> 32:08.510
can barely afford

32:08.510 --> 32:09.880
to eat fish anymore?

32:14.270 --> 32:15.110
Let's go.

32:15.590 --> 32:16.830
He doesn't know anything.

32:19.070 --> 32:20.720
Let's try our luck and take the waterway.

32:21.100 --> 32:21.900
Take the land route.

32:25.230 --> 32:26.710
I know where to find them.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.660
[Serenity]

32:41.480 --> 32:42.110
I noticed you didn't

32:42.110 --> 32:43.070
eat much at dinner.

32:44.240 --> 32:45.240
I made some porridge.

32:46.030 --> 32:47.000
Do you want to try it?

33:04.400 --> 33:05.440
Are you mad at me?

33:05.590 --> 33:06.400
No.

33:10.640 --> 33:11.440
Tanyin,

33:12.750 --> 33:14.110
has anyone told you before

33:15.030 --> 33:15.880
that you are

33:16.890 --> 33:18.400
really bad at lying?

33:21.660 --> 33:22.450
How unlucky.

33:24.110 --> 33:25.110
You met me.

33:25.790 --> 33:27.160
I'm the best liar

33:28.390 --> 33:29.630
in this world.

33:31.080 --> 33:31.990
In the future,

33:32.590 --> 33:35.070
you will be completely fooled by me.

33:37.870 --> 33:39.060
Don't say that.

33:43.000 --> 33:43.620
Fine.

33:45.480 --> 33:46.640
I swear to the heavens that

33:47.240 --> 33:48.350
I, Yuanzhong, will never

33:49.190 --> 33:50.400
lie to you again.

33:51.200 --> 33:52.270
If I break this oath,

33:52.580 --> 33:54.100
let my divine soul perish

33:54.750 --> 33:56.070
and never be reincarnated.

33:56.240 --> 33:57.680
Don't say that!

34:17.480 --> 34:18.360
Don't blame me.

34:20.110 --> 34:21.230
Don't be mad at me

34:22.320 --> 34:23.480
and don't ignore me.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.550
I know

34:26.070 --> 34:27.280
I shouldn't force you,

34:29.469 --> 34:30.840
but you have to understand me.

34:33.070 --> 34:34.710
I really have no other solutions.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.440
I've been scared lately.

34:40.170 --> 34:41.860
Just like when I was young,

34:42.480 --> 34:43.889
I'm having nightmares every night.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.719
I'm afraid that when I open my eyes,

34:48.710 --> 34:49.880
you'll be gone.

34:51.840 --> 34:52.920
I can't ask you

34:53.030 --> 34:54.190
and I don't dare to ask.

34:55.670 --> 34:56.480
I haven't been this afraid

34:56.480 --> 34:57.880
in a long time.

34:58.440 --> 34:59.810
I know I'm losing control.

35:00.000 --> 35:00.960
But I just...

35:03.030 --> 35:04.190
I just want to grab onto something

35:04.190 --> 35:05.400
with all my might.

35:13.550 --> 35:15.190
I will come back.

35:17.510 --> 35:19.230
No matter what happens,

35:19.640 --> 35:21.480
I will come back to you.

35:21.840 --> 35:23.400
I will always be with you.

35:24.440 --> 35:25.840
I promised you.

35:34.110 --> 35:35.070
Why do you

35:36.760 --> 35:37.880
cry so much now?

35:42.610 --> 35:43.780
I don't.

35:48.880 --> 35:51.680
♫Too many old dreams♫

35:52.120 --> 35:55.140
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

35:55.920 --> 35:59.760
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

35:59.790 --> 36:02.610
♫No one is irrelevant♫

36:02.920 --> 36:03.710
Ji Tanyin,

36:05.070 --> 36:06.440
you're the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

36:06.200 --> 36:08.870
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

36:07.720 --> 36:09.030
You're someone that many people

36:09.130 --> 36:12.620
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

36:09.480 --> 36:11.150
worship like a god.

36:11.880 --> 36:12.880
You must

36:13.320 --> 36:14.150
keep your promise.

36:13.480 --> 36:17.310
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

36:16.190 --> 36:17.320
Since you've said

36:17.330 --> 36:20.360
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

36:17.590 --> 36:18.630
you'll stay with me,

36:18.920 --> 36:20.400
then you must always stay with me.

36:21.320 --> 36:22.480
Since you've said

36:21.630 --> 36:23.630
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

36:22.590 --> 36:23.960
you will stay by my side,

36:23.800 --> 36:25.800
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

36:25.150 --> 36:25.880
then you must always

36:25.880 --> 36:27.110
stay by my side.

36:26.110 --> 36:29.890
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

36:29.670 --> 36:31.400
I'm also a good family's son.

36:30.220 --> 36:32.220
♫If between oaths♫

36:32.150 --> 36:33.760
I've fought on the battlefield for the human race

36:32.490 --> 36:34.300
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

36:33.760 --> 36:34.710
and Youhu Clan.

36:34.550 --> 36:38.120
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

36:35.230 --> 36:36.360
I've charged in battle

36:36.760 --> 36:38.320
and achieved merits.

36:38.790 --> 36:41.180
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

36:39.960 --> 36:40.590
You can't

36:40.590 --> 36:41.960
be like a swindler

36:41.210 --> 36:43.480
♫Longing fades in half♫

36:42.450 --> 36:43.940
and run away after taking advantage of me.

36:43.510 --> 36:47.690
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

36:44.820 --> 36:46.260
Who's a swindler?

36:48.500 --> 36:55.000
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

36:50.800 --> 36:51.590
Tanyin,

36:52.590 --> 36:53.760
what I said today

36:55.280 --> 36:56.710
was not out of impulse.

36:57.760 --> 36:58.760
I've thought about

36:58.660 --> 37:01.330
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

36:59.400 --> 37:00.840
this matter for a long time.

37:01.590 --> 37:05.080
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

37:01.710 --> 37:02.880
Today was just

37:03.030 --> 37:04.480
coincidental timing.

37:05.360 --> 37:06.920
That day on the tower of Yandu City,

37:06.140 --> 37:09.970
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

37:07.960 --> 37:08.960
I wanted to destroy the world.

37:09.990 --> 37:13.030
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

37:10.440 --> 37:11.630
You were the one who stopped me.

37:12.320 --> 37:13.320
From then on,

37:14.030 --> 37:15.510
I've made up my mind.

37:14.290 --> 37:16.290
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

37:16.460 --> 37:18.460
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

37:16.880 --> 37:17.800
I must

37:18.480 --> 37:20.030
be with you for this lifetime.

37:18.780 --> 37:22.550
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

37:21.360 --> 37:23.030
I want you to be my wife.

37:22.810 --> 37:24.980
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

37:24.190 --> 37:25.320
No one

37:25.010 --> 37:27.160
♫The light finally dims♫

37:25.630 --> 37:26.510
and nothing

37:27.180 --> 37:31.170
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

37:27.590 --> 37:28.840
can change this.

37:30.630 --> 37:31.670
Even you

37:31.480 --> 37:33.880
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

37:32.920 --> 37:33.710
can't.

37:33.900 --> 37:35.900
♫Longing fades in half♫

37:35.950 --> 37:40.400
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

37:38.320 --> 37:39.110
So...

37:40.710 --> 37:48.020
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

37:42.280 --> 37:43.400
Will you marry me?

37:45.230 --> 37:46.880
I will love you well,

37:47.890 --> 37:48.690
respect you,

37:48.850 --> 37:51.090
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

37:49.460 --> 37:50.350
and care for you.

37:51.110 --> 37:53.180
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

37:51.240 --> 37:52.550
You will be my priority

37:53.380 --> 37:57.130
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

37:53.670 --> 37:54.960
and I'll always think for you.

37:56.030 --> 37:57.110
You have to promise me.

37:57.460 --> 37:59.630
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

37:58.600 --> 37:59.730
Even if you guide me after death,

37:59.660 --> 38:01.810
♫The light finally dims♫

38:01.550 --> 38:02.710
you must do it completely.

38:01.830 --> 38:05.810
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

38:06.130 --> 38:08.520
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

38:08.550 --> 38:10.550
♫Longing fades in half♫

38:10.590 --> 38:15.040
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

38:15.360 --> 38:25.250
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

38:47.880 --> 38:49.550
Your handwriting is good.

38:49.880 --> 38:50.760
Look at mine.

38:51.010 --> 38:52.050
How is it?

38:52.400 --> 38:53.320
Show her.

38:54.640 --> 38:55.740
Ji Tanyin.

38:55.880 --> 38:57.320
What do you think of my calligraphy?

38:56.840 --> 38:58.130
♫Listening♫

38:58.150 --> 39:01.650
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

38:59.400 --> 39:00.280
What's wrong?

39:01.000 --> 39:01.670
We don't need your help

39:01.670 --> 39:03.030
for this type of matter.

39:01.680 --> 39:04.640
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

39:03.030 --> 39:04.280
We can do it ourselves.

39:05.150 --> 39:07.070
I'm happy. I want to help.

39:05.540 --> 39:06.910
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

39:06.930 --> 39:08.890
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

39:07.320 --> 39:09.150
After you get married,

39:09.090 --> 39:13.550
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

39:09.150 --> 39:10.550
will you finally leave?

39:12.360 --> 39:13.150
Dream on.

39:14.280 --> 39:15.440
♫Tonight♫

39:15.280 --> 39:16.360
What does that mean?

39:15.600 --> 39:19.460
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

39:16.760 --> 39:18.360
Tell me, what does that mean?

39:18.360 --> 39:19.670
It means "no way."

39:19.480 --> 39:22.330
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

39:21.070 --> 39:22.710
Tanyin, look.

39:22.720 --> 39:24.360
♫I only wish♫

39:23.590 --> 39:24.320
No,

39:24.320 --> 39:25.670
I'm busy making wedding pastries.

39:24.380 --> 39:26.210
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

39:25.670 --> 39:26.440
Look!

39:26.440 --> 39:27.630
See if my papercutting is pretty.

39:26.620 --> 39:30.790
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

39:28.510 --> 39:29.320
Not pretty.

39:30.030 --> 39:30.920
No?

39:31.400 --> 39:32.370
♫The wind blows♫

39:31.670 --> 39:33.000
I think it's pretty.

39:32.400 --> 39:33.790
♫It stirs the scenery♫

39:33.880 --> 39:34.760
Why don't you teach me?

39:34.000 --> 39:35.540
♫It awakens our heart♫

39:34.760 --> 39:35.630
Let's cut it together.

39:35.570 --> 39:39.210
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

39:35.710 --> 39:36.880
I told you

39:36.920 --> 39:38.800
I'll make wedding pastries and you do papercutting.

39:38.800 --> 39:40.030
Don't bother me.

39:39.840 --> 39:41.080
♫The closer we get♫

39:40.110 --> 39:40.920
You...

39:41.070 --> 39:41.960
You won't accompany me?

39:41.110 --> 39:42.710
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

39:42.000 --> 39:42.800
I won't.

39:42.740 --> 39:44.110
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

39:44.130 --> 39:48.450
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

39:44.230 --> 39:45.030
Then

39:46.190 --> 39:46.960
I'll stay here

39:46.960 --> 39:48.280
to make wedding pastries with you.

39:48.580 --> 39:49.580
♫The wind blows♫

39:49.600 --> 39:51.360
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

39:50.400 --> 39:51.190
No.

39:51.410 --> 39:53.060
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

39:53.080 --> 39:57.260
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

39:57.290 --> 39:58.520
♫The wind blows♫

39:58.540 --> 40:00.130
♫It reddens my eyes♫

40:00.160 --> 40:02.160
♫It warms the promise we made♫

40:02.270 --> 40:05.790
♫In the wind, we gently♫

40:05.820 --> 40:08.500
♫Drift into a better place♫

40:10.480 --> 40:11.450
♫The wind blows♫

40:11.470 --> 40:12.870
♫It stirs the scenery♫

