♫Drift into a better place♫

41:09.920 --> 41:10.720
Yuanzhong.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.200
What's wrong?

41:26.190 --> 41:27.000
Nothing.

41:28.960 --> 41:29.960
There must be something.

41:30.670 --> 41:31.590
What happened?

41:44.320 --> 41:46.190
I saw you in my dream.

41:50.150 --> 41:51.590
You were wearing this

41:53.000 --> 41:54.190
and looked so scary.

41:58.680 --> 41:59.470
In the dream…

42:03.590 --> 42:04.760
Dreams show opposite things.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.280
The scarier I was in the dream,

42:09.230 --> 42:12.150
the happier I'll be in reality.

42:16.590 --> 42:17.510
Did I kiss you

42:18.480 --> 42:19.360
in the dream?

42:39.980 --> 42:40.790
So,

42:41.880 --> 42:43.320
that wasn't the real me.

42:47.630 --> 42:48.800
Are you still afraid?

43:29.690 --> 43:30.480
Barrier?

43:42.090 --> 43:42.970
Someone is coming.
